        "headingId": 1091,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Ovary</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-25T19:14:59"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 1076,
    "bookid": 85,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 1092,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 152291,
        "bookId": 85,
        "chapterId": 120,
        "headingId": 1092,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Patients may present with symptoms related to a pelvic mass, or the tumour may be an incidental finding.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-25T19:14:59"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 1077,
    "bookid": 85,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 1093,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 152292,
        "bookId": 85,
        "chapterId": 120,
        "headingId": 1093,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>These are uncommon tumours typically occurring in postmenopausal women.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-25T19:14:59"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 1078,
    "bookid": 85,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Etiology",
    "headingPosition": 9,
    "headingid": 1094,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 152293,
        "bookId": 85,
        "chapterId": 120,
        "headingId": 1094,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Unknown</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-25T19:14:59"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 1079,
    "bookid": 85,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Pathogenesis",
    "headingPosition": 10,
    "headingid": 1095,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 152294,
        "bookId": 85,
        "chapterId": 120,
        "headingId": 1095,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Endometrioid adenofibromas are sometimes associated with endometriosis or an endometriotic cyst {40527365; 21534769}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-25T19:14:59"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 1086,
    "bookid": 85,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Macroscopic appearance",
    "headingPosition": 11,
    "headingid": 1102,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 152295,
        "bookId": 85,
        "chapterId": 120,
        "headingId": 1102,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Endometrioid adenofibromas are typically solid with a firm, white cut surface, sometimes with small cysts. They may form a nodule in the wall of an endometriotic cyst {21534769}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-25T19:14:59"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 1080,
    "bookid": 85,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Histopathology",
    "headingPosition": 12,
    "headingid": 1096,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 152296,
        "bookId": 85,
        "chapterId": 120,
        "headingId": 1096,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Endometrioid adenofibromas are often associated with endometriosis. They are characterized by fibromatous stroma containing widely spaced, cytologically bland, endometrioid glands {8463037}. Morular, squamous, and mucinous differentiation can occur {8463037}. Dystrophic stromal calcifications may be present.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-25T19:14:59"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 1081,
    "bookid": 85,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Cytology",
    "headingPosition": 13,
    "headingid": 1097,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 152297,
        "bookId": 85,
        "chapterId": 120,
        "headingId": 1097,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-25T19:14:59"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 1082,
    "bookid": 85,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Diagnostic molecular pathology",
    "headingPosition": 14,
    "headingid": 1098,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 152298,
        "bookId": 85,
        "chapterId": 120,
        "headingId": 1098,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-25T19:14:59"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 1085,
    "bookid": 85,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Essential and desirable diagnostic criteria",
    "headingPosition": 15,
    "headingid": 1101,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 152299,
        "bookId": 85,
        "chapterId": 120,
        "headingId": 1101,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> widely spaced benign endometrioid glands associated with fibromatous stroma.</p>\r\n<p><em>Desirable:</em> endometriosis.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-25T19:14:59"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 1083,
    "bookid": 85,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Staging",
    "headingPosition": 16,
    "headingid": 1099,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 152300,
        "bookId": 85,
        "chapterId": 120,
        "headingId": 1099,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>These are benign tumours and are not staged.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-25T19:14:59"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 1084,
    "bookid": 85,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Prognosis and prediction",
    "headingPosition": 17,
    "headingid": 1100,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 152301,
        "bookId": 85,
        "chapterId": 120,
        "headingId": 1100,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>These tumours are benign.</p>",
